+    // ===== PROBE_EVEN diagnostic (throwaway branch; never merge) =====
+    // Three guesses at why an even divisor correction breaks this conversion have now failed
+    // (CM-point collision, then coprimality to N).  Stop guessing: report exactly WHICH cells
